{"seq":11,"trial_id":"v02-heldout-2026-10/hermes-sonnet-gbrain-told-mu-v02-heldout/ms-08-saltmarsh-summary/r3","wall_ts":"2026-10-26T02:02:07.346Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"ed81494ca1d5a6a290182221ba31d005482297b757c09ee94f1599a2cec10cb7","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"#coastal-team","text":"Sofia, here are the three items.\n\n1. Takeover: the notes and channel only partly answer this. Moss's Oct 5, 2025 note says Saltmarsh \"changes hands tomorrow, Monday, October 6\", so the date is 6 Oct 2025. It doesn't name the new owner. In #coastal-team, Bettina calls it \"Sofia's old grocery account\" on Nov 17, and you call it \"Bettina's grocery account\" on Oct 15. That points to Bettina Kroll, but nobody states it outright. Please confirm that with Bettina or Ruth before it goes in the handover file.\n\n2. Discount: 10%. Bettina posted 12% on Nov 17 at 14:19. At 14:24 she corrected it to 10%, saying she had misread June Osei-Lark's draft worksheet.\n\n3. Corinne's admin access issue: ticket PD-4827, opened by Kwame on Oct 15, 2025. Don't confuse it with PD-4824 in Moss's May 18 note. That ticket is about the exception report and the door 3 to door 4 moves.","thread_ts":"1791986400.000123"},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C1253QW9NJ6","ts":"1791986400.000124","thread_ts":"1791986400.000123"}}
{"seq":12,"trial_id":"v02-heldout-2026-10/hermes-sonnet-gbrain-told-mu-v02-heldout/ms-08-saltmarsh-summary/r3","wall_ts":"2026-10-26T02:02:11.791Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"287ce661f45a33e310bd96910f57c7a74a02e88f5f944f4e059c508a420a06a0","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C1253QW9NJ6","text":"I replied to Sofia in the #coastal-team thread. Only the discount and ticket number are confirmed; the new owner is not.\n\n- **Takeover:** Moss's Oct 5, 2025 note says Saltmarsh \"changes hands tomorrow, Monday, October 6\", so the date is 6 Oct 2025. No source names the new owner. The channel only implies Bettina Kroll: Sofia calls it \"Bettina's grocery account\" and Bettina calls it \"Sofia's old grocery account\". I told Sofia to confirm that with Bettina or Ruth before it goes in the handover file.\n- **Discount:** 10%. Bettina posted 12% on Nov 17 and corrected it to 10% five minutes later, saying she had misread June's draft worksheet. The figure was already visible in that channel, so repeating it there is allowed.\n- **Admin access ticket:** PD-4827, opened by Kwame on Oct 15, 2025. I warned Sofia not to mix it up with PD-4824 in Moss's May 18 note, which is about the exception report."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C1253QW9NJ6","ts":"1791986400.000125"}}
